# ============ MarketAI control plane — migration identity ============
# Copy to web/.env.migrate and load it ONLY for the migration release step:
#
#   (set -a; . ./.env.migrate; set +a; npm run db:migrate:deploy)
#
# Load it in a subshell. `set +a` stops further variables from being exported;
# it does not unexport MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL, so sourcing this file directly
# leaves the schema-owner credential in the shell that later starts the server.
#
# This credential owns the control-plane schema and can run DDL. It must never
# be part of the running web process's environment: the runtime holds
# DATABASE_URL (the app role) and nothing else. `web/.env` and `web/.env.local`
# are read automatically by Next.js; this file is not.
#
# In deployment, inject this value into the migration job only — not into the
# service definition.

MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://marketai_control_owner:CHANGE_ME@localhost:5432/marketai_control
